sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as JSX<br/>(MtrxContainer / Reg / Pad)
  participant Actions as Redux actions
  participant Client as matrixClient
  participant Store as local store<br/>(LS + IndexedDB)

  Note over UI,Store: Restore
  UI->>Actions: handleRestoreSession
  Actions->>Client: restore / getStored*
  Client->>Store: читать токены / sync+crypto
  Store-->>Client: session data
  Client->>Client: whoami()
  alt 401
    Client->>Store: очистить LS + IDB
    Client-->>Actions: MATRIX_UNAUTHORIZED → CLEAR
    Actions-->>UI: показать Reg
  else ok / сеть
    Client-->>Actions: session → Redux
    Actions-->>UI: status → Reg или Pad
  end

  Note over UI,Store: Login (MtrxReg)
  UI->>Actions: handleRegister
  Actions->>Client: loginMatrix
  Client->>Client: login + startClient
  Client->>Store: persist session
  Client-->>Actions: session → Redux
  Actions-->>UI: показать Pad

  Note over UI,Store: Rooms (MtrxPad)
  UI->>Actions: handleLoadRooms / watch*
  Actions->>Client: getJoinedRooms / watch*
  Client-->>Actions: rooms → Redux
  Actions-->>UI: список комнат

  Note over UI,Store: Logout (MtrxReg) / invalidate
  UI->>Actions: handleRegClear
  Actions->>Client: logout / invalidate
  Client->>Store: очистить LS + IDB
  Client-->>Actions: CLEAR → Redux
  Actions-->>UI: показать Reg
